      "insight": "Readers are not clicking stablecoin stories for the crypto mechanics — they are clicking to watch legacy payment incumbents (Deutsche Bank, BBVA, Bank of America, Stripe, Visa) cross the line from observer to participant, treating capitulation by TradFi as the real signal that stablecoin rails have won.",
